    "description": "Nihon Kogyo Co., Ltd. engages in the civil engineering, landscaping, and exterior design businesses in Japan. The company designs and manufactures concrete products, including box culvert, culvert, retaining wall, road, underground cables, waterway, river, ocean, special concrete, and dam related products used for roads, sewer, bank construction, artificial reef, disaster prevention and mitigation, as well as the maintenance and repair of infrastructure, such as highways, bridges, and tunnels. It also offers paving materials, furniture used in parks, wood cleats, construction products, and disaster prevention and mitigation items. In addition, the company provides gardening and pet-related products comprising garden sink, shower place, standing faucet unit, disaster prevention and mitigation, entrance and approach, around the garden, parking, raku shiba, exterior related materials, and other exterior products. Further, it manufactures and sells products for public spaces; and undertakes evil engineering and block construction. Nihon Kogyo Co., Ltd. was founded in 1945 and is headquartered in Sanuki, Japan."
